        <fr:title text="Candidates to survey">Candidates to survey</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>Initial, non-exhaustive list of areas likely to contain upstreamable material. Each entry needs its own audit before a PR is opened.</html:p>
        <html:ul><html:li>Displayed-category infrastructure not already in <html:code>Cubical/Categories/Displayed/</html:code>.</html:li>
<html:li>Presheaf and copresheaf utility lemmas, Yoneda variants.</html:li>
<html:li>Standard functor / natural transformation combinators that live in CCL but are not logic-specific.</html:li>
<html:li>Comma category / slice / coslice constructions.</html:li>
<html:li>Universal property packaging (adjunctions, (co)limits expressed via representability).</html:li>
<html:li>2-category and double-category material once the <fr:link href="/sss-009X/" title="Double Category Theory in Cubical Categorical Logic" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-009X/" display-uri="sss-009X" type="local">double-category milestone</fr:link> stabilises — that milestone is the natural upstream source.</html:li></html:ul>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
