      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:ul><html:li>Coordinate with Max on which pieces he considers CCL-proprietary vs. fair game for upstreaming.</html:li>
<html:li>Does the <html:code>agda/cubical</html:code> maintainer group prefer many small PRs or topic-grouped batches? Check the contribution guide before opening the first one.</html:li>
